# What never goes into a build context.
#
# Two of these are correctness, not tidiness: `**/dist` keeps a stale local
# build from being copied over a fresh one, and `**/*.db` keeps a developer's
# record — which may be a partner's record — out of an image that gets pushed
# to a registry.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-journal
backups/
.git
.gitignore
.claude/
**/.DS_Store
*.md
